{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t日本朝日電視台報道，一名20多歲的中國男遊客日前在富士山失聯，可能已遇險。<br/>\n<br/>\n報道稱，男子本月8日上午獨自登山，隨後失聯。警方、消防等部門星期二早上起進行搜尋，但未發現其蹤跡。<br/>\n<br/>\n新華社引述中國駐日本大使館表示，男子家屬計劃前往日本搜尋，使館正提供協助。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:28:27.712895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:53:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:58:04.118754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:58.504611+00:00","content_hash":"9587d0a0b6fbbd91c33ba6812ac8f09cc241e8b12b4d33674986d1ac80609a99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}